2a25a-imageUrl.webp","m":"Rijksmuseum","e":"rijksmuseum-prints2-collection","d":"1822","u":""},{"id":"RP-P-OB-206.639","n":"Neemt, kleinen, neemt vrolijk, beziet deze prent, / Zij maakt u met Kl","a":"Christiaan Cornelis Lucas van Staden (me","i":"https://pub-396fad1f96754c2f816f260faf970e63.r2.dev/artworks/rijksmuseum-prints2-collection/RP-P-OB-206_639-0f44a948-imageUrl.webp","m":"Rijksmuseum","e":"rijksmuseum-prints2-collection","d":"1822","u":""},{"id":"RP-P-OB-205.195","n":"Ziet wat in deeze prent elks beeld en werk beduidt, / En kiest, \u00f4 kind","a":"Christiaan Cornelis Lucas van Staden (me","i":"https://pub-396fad1f96754c2f816f260faf970e63.r2.dev/artworks/rijksmuseum-prints2-collection/RP-P-OB-205_195-9e75da4a-imageUrl.webp","m":"Rijksmuseum","e":"rijksmuseum-prints2-collection","d":"1806","u":""},{"id":"RP-P-OB-205.173","n":"Mejuffer Alida, wiens zinnen / Hoogmoedig, spytig zyn in 't minnen, / ","a":"Christiaan Cornelis Lucas van Staden (me","i":"https://pub-396fad1f96754c2f816f260faf970e63.r2.dev/artworks/rijksmuseum-prints2-collection/RP-P-OB-205_173-a3ccd0d6-imageUrl.webp","m":"Rijksmuseum","e":"rijksmuseum-prints2-collection","d":"1806","u":""},{"id":"RP-P-OB-206.638","n":"Neemt, kleinen, neemt vrolijk, beziet deze prent, / Zij maakt u met Kl","a":"Christiaan Cornelis Lucas van Staden (me","i":"https://pub-396fad1f96754c2f816f260faf970e63.r2.dev/artworks/rijksmuseum-prints2-collection/RP-P-OB-206_638-e6b6919e-imageUrl.webp","m":"Rijksmuseum","e":"rijksmuseum-prints2-collection","d":"1822","u":""},{"id":"RP-P-OB-204.333","n":"Kinderen! hier ziet gij van Speijk's roomrijk leven, daden en dood","a":"Christiaan Cornelis Lucas van Staden (me","i":"https://pub-396fad1f96754c2f816f260faf970e63.r2.dev/artworks/rijksmuseum-prints2-collection/RP-P-OB-204_333-9991bc21-imageUrl.webp","m":"Rijksmuseum","e":"rijksmuseum-prints2-collection","d":"1830","u":""},{"id":"RP-P-OB-206.648","n":"Hier ziet gij, lieve jeugd, veel zaken, / Waarmee gij u wel zult verma","a":"Chr